WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:04.000
<b>Welcome to Lacrosse Club!</b>

00:03.170 --> 00:05.630
<b>What?! Off to the tropics?!</b>

00:05.630 --> 00:08.460
<b>HS 1st Year
Miki Hoshitsuki</b>

00:05.750 --> 00:08.460
<b>Jeez you two, keep it down!</b>

00:08.460 --> 00:09.880
<b>Right, sorry!</b>

00:09.880 --> 00:12.880
<b>I'm so jealous though! 
A summer in the tropics!</b>

00:13.630 --> 00:16.040
<b>I feel bad, it's just 
for the Hoshimori Class.</b>

00:16.040 --> 00:18.040
<b>Oh no, don't even worry.</b>

00:18.420 --> 00:21.830
<b>We all know how hard you girls work.</b>

00:21.830 --> 00:22.670
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:22.670 --> 00:25.290
<b>Sometimes you just gotta get out there
and enjoy yourselves a bit!</b>

00:25.290 --> 00:27.630
<b>Thanks Mayu and Kei!</b>

00:28.790 --> 00:30.710
<b>I'll bring you back lots of goodies!</b>

00:30.710 --> 00:32.250
<b>You just wait!</b>

00:40.330 --> 00:41.330
<b>The beach!</b>

00:41.330 --> 00:42.540
<b>The tropics!</b>

00:42.540 --> 00:43.750
<b>Here goes!</b>

00:43.750 --> 00:45.170
<b>Cannonball!</b>

00:50.380 --> 00:53.330
<b>HS 1st Year
Haruka Narumi
HS 3rd Year
Asuha Kusunoki</b>

00:54.790 --> 00:56.580
<b>Can't beat this!</b>

00:54.790 --> 00:58.000
<b>JH 3rd Year
Urara Hasumi
JH 3rd Year
Kokomi Asahina</b>

00:56.580 --> 00:58.000
<b>No doubt.</b>

00:58.000 --> 01:01.330
<b>Even the air feels better than usual.</b>

01:08.330 --> 01:10.580
<b>HS 3rd Year
Renge Serizawa</b>

01:08.330 --> 01:10.580
<b>C'mon, don't play hard to get!</b>

01:10.790 --> 01:13.460
<b>I'll rub all that sunscreen in for you!</b>

01:13.580 --> 01:15.790
<b>JH 2nd Year
Michelle Watagi</b>

01:14.170 --> 01:15.790
<b>Nooooo!</b>

01:16.500 --> 01:19.290
<b>Oh wow. That looks great on you.</b>

01:18.710 --> 01:21.420
<b>HS 2nd Year
Yuri Himukai 
HS 2nd Year
HS 2nd Year                                                                                                                            Nozomi Amano  
Kurumi Tokiwa</b>

01:19.290 --> 01:21.420
<b>S-stop staring like that!</b>

01:22.790 --> 01:25.960
<b>Kurumi was the one who picked this out.</b>

01:27.920 --> 01:30.250
<b>And you look really cute in it, Yuri.</b>

01:30.250 --> 01:33.710
<b>No need to be so bashful! 
It looks amazing on you!</b>

01:33.710 --> 01:36.460
<b>It does. I'm glad I helped you find it.</b>

01:39.290 --> 01:41.750
<b>Okay! Everyone gather round!</b>

01:41.960 --> 01:45.000
<b>It's time to go over your training course.</b>

01:46.830 --> 01:47.710
<b>Wha-?!</b>

01:49.830 --> 01:51.040
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

01:51.040 --> 01:54.210
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

01:54.210 --> 01:59.040
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

01:59.790 --> 02:04.880
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

02:08.790 --> 02:14.830
<b>Now among the stars that stretch as far as the eye can see,
find the constellation of your dreams</b>

02:14.830 --> 02:23.250
<b>Bring your hearts together 
and someday it will come true</b>

02:31.580 --> 02:36.540
<b>Are you ready to run for it?</b>

02:37.000 --> 02:42.080
<b>The road is long, but you've 
got your friends with you</b>

02:42.500 --> 02:46.790
<b>Instead of just making faces and worrying</b>

02:46.790 --> 02:51.710
<b>Just go in head-first with a smile</b>

02:52.290 --> 02:57.750
<b>As hearts cross even in mere passing</b>

02:57.750 --> 03:00.460
<b>They will grow into deeper bonds</b>

03:00.460 --> 03:07.630
<b>Bring them together as one and find 
the power to take on the future</b>

03:08.290 --> 03:14.130
<b>Now look up to the stars as far as the eye can see
and keep chasing that dream</b>

03:14.130 --> 03:19.540
<b>That outreached hand will 
encourage you not to give up</b>

03:19.540 --> 03:25.040
<b>No matter how many hundreds of 
tries it takes, you're not alone</b>

03:25.040 --> 03:32.040
<b>You can do it, look up, 
there's surely a starry sky</b>

03:32.040 --> 03:34.880
<b>Your dreams will come true</b>

03:37.040 --> 03:42.000
<b>Episode 3
Resort x Retreat x Escape?</b>

03:52.830 --> 03:55.330
<b>G-got it...</b>

03:56.670 --> 03:58.960
<b>This is not what I imagined it to be...</b>

03:58.960 --> 04:00.750
<b>We've been duped!</b>

04:01.210 --> 04:06.710
<b>A "three day tropical resort getaway",
is that what you call this?</b>

04:07.080 --> 04:10.460
<b>I don't recall mentioning 
any such questionable plans.</b>

04:10.460 --> 04:13.250
<b>This is training camp.</b>

04:13.250 --> 04:15.330
<b>Of course we're gonna have to work a bit.</b>

04:15.330 --> 04:18.630
<b>Weren't we doing that at school already...?</b>

04:18.630 --> 04:24.040
<b>Yes, but as we overcome the brutal heat of
the tropics here, we may achieve something greater.</b>

04:25.500 --> 04:29.210
<b>Now, I know this might be a little hard,
but let's push through, shall we?</b>

04:29.630 --> 04:32.250
<b>Your teachers are here to support you!</b>

04:32.630 --> 04:34.790
<b>Trying to fake motivation into us?</b>

04:34.790 --> 04:37.080
<b>N-no! Of course not!</b>

04:37.080 --> 04:38.500
<b>Be that as it may.</b>

04:38.830 --> 04:41.460
<b>We don't all run on the same stamina.</b>

04:41.460 --> 04:43.500
<b>I do hope you realize that.</b>

04:41.460 --> 04:44.290
<b>JH 2nd Year
Kaede Sendoin
JH 1st Year
Sadone</b>

04:43.500 --> 04:45.750
<b>Anyone who can't keep 
up should just drop out.</b>

04:47.830 --> 04:50.580
<b>If you're not even going to try and get better,
you'll just get in the way.</b>

04:51.710 --> 04:53.250
<b>Say that again!</b>

05:00.170 --> 05:02.830
<b>All right! Gimme another set!</b>

05:02.830 --> 05:04.330
<b>Whaaat!</b>

05:04.670 --> 05:07.380
<b>Monster... You're a true monster...!</b>

05:05.000 --> 05:07.380
<b>JH 1st Year
Sakura Fujimiya</b>

05:15.080 --> 05:17.960
<b>HS 3rd Year
Anko Tsubusaki</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:17.960
<b>I'm so... not hungry...</b>

05:17.960 --> 05:22.790
<b>They go ahead and take away our vacation,
but then still serve up a fancy meal like this...</b>

05:23.250 --> 05:25.710
<b>This was all done with intent...</b>

05:26.040 --> 05:27.630
<b>Yeowch!</b>

05:27.630 --> 05:30.500
<b>Jeez, just look how sunburned I am already.</b>

05:30.710 --> 05:36.040
<b>After our bath I'll be quite sure to
take care of Every-Last-Inch!</b>

05:36.750 --> 05:38.750
<b>Uh, I'll pass...</b>

05:40.130 --> 05:43.830
<b>HS 1st Year
Subaru Wakaba</b>

05:40.880 --> 05:43.830
<b>But hey, where's the Fortissimo duo?</b>

05:45.880 --> 05:49.330
<b>Shiho and Kanon both wanted
to be here for this too, but...</b>

05:49.330 --> 05:52.670
<b>Even though they're super busy? What a pair!</b>

05:53.040 --> 05:55.690
<b>That's the kind of spirit 
it takes if you want to be</b>

05:55.690 --> 05:58.790
<b>a superstar and a Hoshimori 
member at the same time.</b>

06:00.250 --> 06:04.670
<b>Since we're only dealing with half that,
we better work even harder!</b>

06:04.670 --> 06:05.540
<b>You're right!</b>

06:05.540 --> 06:07.710
<b>Okay! Let's do this!</b>

06:07.960 --> 06:08.790
<b>All right.</b>

06:08.790 --> 06:11.040
<b>Once everyone's done eating,
let's head out for a run!</b>

06:08.790 --> 06:11.380
<b>HS 1st Year
Misaki</b>

06:11.420 --> 06:12.460
<b>What?!</b>

06:16.580 --> 06:18.080
<b>Okay girls, listen up.</b>

06:18.500 --> 06:22.140
<b>Starting from today, along with your 
normal training we're going to give</b>

06:22.140 --> 06:24.240
<b>you an extra project to work on.</b>

06:24.240 --> 06:25.290
<b>No way!</b>

06:25.540 --> 06:29.460
<b>A project? Like summer homework or something?</b>

06:29.460 --> 06:33.500
<b>No thank you! We hardly have 
any down time as it is!</b>

06:34.210 --> 06:35.380
<b>Come on!</b>

06:35.380 --> 06:37.290
<b>I want a break!</b>

06:37.630 --> 06:39.420
<b>We wanna play!</b>

06:39.420 --> 06:40.960
<b>What exactly will we be doing?</b>

06:41.330 --> 06:42.580
<b>That'd be this!</b>

06:43.750 --> 06:46.830
<b>You're all going to learn 
to dance along to this!</b>

06:46.830 --> 06:48.210
<b>What? Fortissimo?</b>

06:48.750 --> 06:50.040
<b>Dance...?</b>

06:50.040 --> 06:52.420
<b>I thought this was battle training?</b>

06:52.710 --> 06:54.540
<b>What is even going on anymore?</b>

06:58.330 --> 07:04.170
<b>The celestial suits you all wear draw their power
from certain motions you make.</b>

07:04.630 --> 07:06.420
<b>Think of this as a martial art.</b>

07:08.000 --> 07:12.880
<b>Martial arts require form and rhythm,
just like dancing does.</b>

07:13.580 --> 07:18.580
<b>Follow along to this Fortissimo song and
master the movements we're about to teach you!</b>

07:20.000 --> 07:23.330
<b>If you can do that,
those celestial suits of yours will react to it,</b>

07:23.330 --> 07:25.750
<b>and you'll unlock even greater powers!</b>

07:28.880 --> 07:30.630
<b>We're going to fight by dancing?</b>

07:30.630 --> 07:33.920
<b>JH 1st Year
Hinata Minami</b>

07:30.920 --> 07:31.920
<b>Really?</b>

07:31.920 --> 07:36.130
<b>Well, it sounds fun! I'm gonna give it a go!</b>

07:36.500 --> 07:39.670
<b>Perhaps if it were a tamer sort of dance...</b>

07:39.670 --> 07:42.040
<b>I'm not cut out for this...</b>

07:42.250 --> 07:46.580
<b>No need to fear! For all your dancing needs
the lovely Urara is here!</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:48.460
<b>U-Urara?</b>

07:48.710 --> 07:51.500
<b>Dance like Fortissimo you say?</b>

07:51.500 --> 07:53.630
<b>Huh? Wha-? Wait!</b>

07:53.630 --> 07:54.880
<b>We've got that down pact!</b>

07:54.880 --> 07:56.380
<b>Huh?</b>

07:56.580 --> 08:00.500
<b>Uhh, right, but this is 
all-original choreography.</b>

08:01.250 --> 08:03.080
<b>O-of course I knew that!</b>

08:03.080 --> 08:05.420
<b>I just mean I'll have it down in a flash!</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:06.880
<b>Good! That's the spirit!</b>

08:07.460 --> 08:09.630
<b>We'll play the full video for you now.</b>

08:09.960 --> 08:12.580
<b>Work on learning the rhythm for starters.</b>

08:12.580 --> 08:13.380
<b>Got it?</b>

08:13.380 --> 08:14.040
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

08:14.040 --> 08:15.460
<b>Yes, ma'am...</b>

08:44.630 --> 08:48.080
<b>I can't say I'm one for 
this athletic stuff...</b>

08:48.250 --> 08:49.960
<b>I think I might be sick...</b>

08:50.670 --> 08:53.750
<b>What happened to our vacation?</b>

08:53.750 --> 08:55.170
<b>When do we get to have fun?!</b>

08:55.460 --> 08:58.790
<b>And after I found this great 
spot and everything...</b>

08:59.170 --> 09:00.580
<b>What sort of spot?</b>

09:00.960 --> 09:03.460
<b>A mystic, romantic, secret sort of spot.</b>

09:03.880 --> 09:05.420
<b>Oh, wow...!</b>

09:07.630 --> 09:08.830
<b>Oh, sorry!</b>

09:08.830 --> 09:10.830
<b>No, it's fine!</b>

09:10.830 --> 09:14.630
<b>You should make sure you take
a good look around you, Sadone.
One and two, one and two, one and...</b>

09:15.380 --> 09:18.380
<b>That and... you should 
be a bit more confident.</b>

09:18.920 --> 09:19.750
<b>Yeah...</b>

09:19.750 --> 09:22.710
<b>Kaede! I did it!</b>

09:22.920 --> 09:24.460
<b>Nicely done!</b>

09:24.460 --> 09:27.040
<b>You can do anything you put 
your mind to, can't you?</b>

09:45.630 --> 09:46.790
<b>Well!</b>

09:46.790 --> 09:47.460
<b>Huh?</b>

09:47.460 --> 09:48.880
<b>What a lovely moon.</b>

09:48.880 --> 09:50.790
<b>Sakura? Hinata?</b>

09:50.790 --> 09:53.790
<b>We just happened to notice your empty bed.</b>

09:54.040 --> 09:57.170
<b>Plus, you've been a bit down lately.</b>

09:57.170 --> 09:58.960
<b>We were worried!</b>

10:00.040 --> 10:04.750
<b>Well, if you're merely tired from all this here
then I believe we have something in common.</b>

10:05.000 --> 10:08.250
<b>I dare say I would not blame you
for wanting to head out and-</b>

10:11.670 --> 10:12.960
<b>What's the matter?</b>

10:21.500 --> 10:22.500
<b>Huh?</b>

10:22.500 --> 10:24.250
<b>A-Anko?!</b>

10:24.250 --> 10:27.460
<b>Woops... We've been spotted...</b>

10:27.670 --> 10:30.330
<b>Just what, pray tell, are you 
doing out at a time like this!</b>

10:30.330 --> 10:32.830
<b>You know, we could ask you the same.</b>

10:32.830 --> 10:34.580
<b>Adventure, you see?</b>

10:34.580 --> 10:36.500
<b>We're Anko's Adventure Squad.</b>

10:37.790 --> 10:42.130
<b>And we're on a journey to 
find mystical tropical sites!</b>

10:44.000 --> 10:48.000
<b>Anko Tsubuzaki (3rd Year HS)
Birthday: November 11th
Sign: Scorpio
Blood Type: B
Measurements: 90/63/91
Height: 152cm
Weight: 45kg
Hobby: Blogging
Dream job: Famous blogger &
work-from-home programmer 
Favorite food: Spicy stuff
Dislikes: Red beans</b>

10:48.080 --> 10:52.040
<b>Renge Serizawa (3rd Year HS)
Birthday: June 26th
Sign: Cancer
Blood Type: B
Measurements: 93/63/90
Height: 166cm
Weight: 52kg
Hobby: Girl-watching
Dream job: Nothing really,
but wanted to be a ballerina once 
Favorite food: Strawberries
Dislikes: Garlic</b>

10:52.420 --> 10:55.920
<b>Behold! That there is the spirit 
island we're headed for!</b>

10:55.920 --> 11:01.380
<b>That place is always at the top of the top of
all "Best Sites in Japan" rankings!</b>

11:01.670 --> 11:03.330
<b>"Spirit" Island?</b>

11:03.330 --> 11:05.130
<b>What are "spirits"?</b>

11:05.460 --> 11:09.500
<b>Just a name people have given to
natural and phantasmal phenomenon</b>

11:09.500 --> 11:12.880
<b>they treat with divine reverence.</b>

11:12.880 --> 11:16.330
<b>Exactly! And that island there
is supposed to be full of ghosts!</b>

11:18.380 --> 11:20.000
<b>G-ghosts...?</b>

11:21.210 --> 11:22.710
<b>We might even see some!</b>

11:26.540 --> 11:28.460
<b>You're such a meanie!</b>

11:28.460 --> 11:29.630
<b>Oh jeez, sorry.</b>

11:29.630 --> 11:31.580
<b>Test of courage, hmm?</b>

11:31.580 --> 11:35.250
<b>I must say I don't think 
sounds very young and trendy.</b>

11:35.250 --> 11:37.630
<b>You're the last person I 
want to hear that from.</b>

11:37.630 --> 11:40.170
<b>Maybe it's an old favorite but who cares!</b>

11:40.380 --> 11:45.170
<b>We've been so busy with all our training,
an event like this is just what we need!</b>

11:45.170 --> 11:46.250
<b>A fun event!</b>

11:46.630 --> 11:48.130
<b>Well then.</b>

11:49.130 --> 11:50.130
<b>But...</b>

11:50.670 --> 11:52.420
<b>It sounds kind of fun.</b>

11:54.080 --> 11:56.580
<b>Okay then, time to hit up that island!</b>

11:56.580 --> 11:59.000
<b>Anko's Adventure Squad, moving out!</b>

11:59.000 --> 12:00.250
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:10.290 --> 12:14.290
<b>You know... I feel like the air's
gone cold all of a sudden.</b>

12:14.290 --> 12:17.500
<b>I'd say it's more disturbingly warm.</b>

12:20.750 --> 12:22.630
<b>That's one scare for me!</b>

12:22.630 --> 12:24.460
<b>Now we're even!</b>

12:24.460 --> 12:27.210
<b>This isn't some sort of competition!</b>

12:29.630 --> 12:31.210
<b>Was I just collateral damage...?</b>

12:32.330 --> 12:33.420
<b>But...</b>

12:33.420 --> 12:36.250
<b>you know, the air does feel different.</b>

12:38.710 --> 12:40.540
<b>It feels great!</b>

12:41.330 --> 12:44.000
<b>You really seem to like this place, huh?</b>

12:44.500 --> 12:45.290
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:45.630 --> 12:48.250
<b>How about we head to an even better spot?</b>

13:04.380 --> 13:05.920
<b>Oh wow!</b>

13:05.920 --> 13:08.830
<b>It's beautiful! Like out of a dream!</b>

13:10.330 --> 13:12.130
<b>A sight to behold indeed!</b>

13:12.130 --> 13:14.880
<b>Look! See how far away the hotel is?</b>

13:14.880 --> 13:16.960
<b>We've come so far!</b>

13:17.250 --> 13:20.420
<b>My my, the road back will 
certainly be a long one.</b>

13:20.420 --> 13:21.460
<b>It's beautiful.</b>

13:21.750 --> 13:23.750
<b>Good thing we came out here, right Sadone?</b>

13:23.750 --> 13:24.580
<b>Yeah!</b>

13:24.830 --> 13:27.580
<b>We are all in this together.</b>

13:27.580 --> 13:31.040
<b>Nothing beats time with the 
team to help lift your spirits.</b>

13:38.710 --> 13:41.080
<b>What the...? Something's weird.</b>

13:41.080 --> 13:42.420
<b>Why are there two moons?</b>

13:42.750 --> 13:45.830
<b>What on Earth are you talking about, Anko?</b>

13:45.830 --> 13:47.460
<b>That's not even...</b>

13:47.920 --> 13:49.170
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:49.170 --> 13:50.330
<b>What the...</b>

13:55.210 --> 13:57.580
<b>That's no moon! It's an Irous!</b>

13:58.080 --> 13:59.830
<b>Come in, we've got Irous!</b>

14:03.750 --> 14:05.040
<b>I lost connection!</b>

14:05.040 --> 14:07.420
<b>Think it was because of this 
barrier or whatever it is?</b>

14:07.420 --> 14:08.710
<b>I bet so.</b>

14:08.710 --> 14:11.460
<b>Looks like we'll have to 
deal with this on our own...</b>

14:12.500 --> 14:14.540
<b>First a barrier, now this miasma?</b>

14:14.540 --> 14:16.630
<b>Jeez, not playing nice, huh?</b>

14:17.000 --> 14:18.540
<b>Everyone, get on your celestial suits.</b>

14:21.290 --> 14:23.250
<b>Tsubuzaki! What's the matter?</b>

14:23.250 --> 14:24.580
<b>What's going on?</b>

14:25.960 --> 14:26.960
<b>No use, huh...</b>

14:26.960 --> 14:28.040
<b>Sir!</b>

14:28.250 --> 14:30.000
<b>Are we dealing with Irous?</b>

14:30.210 --> 14:32.750
<b>We are. And an enormous one at that.</b>

14:33.170 --> 14:36.250
<b>And Tsubuzaki seems to be caught up in it.</b>

14:36.250 --> 14:37.880
<b>What? Why?!</b>

14:37.880 --> 14:42.210
<b>Her being her, she probably snuck out
on some adventure.</b>

14:42.540 --> 14:44.630
<b>Sir! Nozomi is missing, too!</b>

14:44.630 --> 14:45.500
<b>What?!</b>

14:45.500 --> 14:46.710
<b>Are we missing anyone else?</b>

14:46.960 --> 14:49.080
<b>Sadone and Hinata are missing, too!</b>

14:49.460 --> 14:52.540
<b>How could we let Nozomi and 
the others get caught...</b>

14:52.540 --> 14:54.290
<b>Sir! Permission to engage!</b>

14:54.540 --> 14:57.420
<b>Roger that! High school first 
years, take the lead and-</b>

15:19.130 --> 15:20.170
<b>Misaki...?</b>

15:22.750 --> 15:24.790
<b>Let us go out there with her!</b>

15:24.790 --> 15:26.880
<b>Okay! Everyone head out together,</b>

15:26.880 --> 15:29.790
<b>rescue Nozomi and the others,
and take down that Irous!</b>

15:30.750 --> 15:31.630
<b>Yes sir!</b>

15:34.670 --> 15:38.290
<b>The Irous itself has turned into a barrier
and covered the whole island?</b>

15:38.750 --> 15:40.630
<b>I've never seen this type before.</b>

15:40.960 --> 15:42.460
<b>What's it doing here?</b>

15:49.500 --> 15:50.920
<b>Well how about this?</b>

15:53.250 --> 15:55.210
<b>Hinata, don't be rash!</b>

15:55.210 --> 15:56.790
<b>I'm... okay...</b>

16:05.290 --> 16:06.330
<b>What the...?!</b>

16:09.000 --> 16:10.080
<b>Misaki!</b>

16:10.080 --> 16:12.000
<b>Sadone! Can you hear me?</b>

16:12.000 --> 16:13.460
<b>Sadone!</b>

16:15.460 --> 16:16.460
<b>Sadone!</b>

16:16.750 --> 16:18.040
<b>Wait! This thing is...!</b>

16:21.500 --> 16:23.500
<b>We can't just jump blindly at it.</b>

16:23.500 --> 16:24.830
<b>What should we do?</b>

16:31.130 --> 16:32.380
<b>It's no good.</b>

16:32.380 --> 16:34.750
<b>My strength's... gone...</b>

16:35.500 --> 16:38.420
<b>At this rate, forget about escaping...</b>

16:39.460 --> 16:43.380
<b>That miasma is going to be the end of us...</b>

16:47.420 --> 16:50.790
<b>If we just break that 
spot there. Just maybe...</b>

16:51.290 --> 16:52.250
<b>But...</b>

16:53.330 --> 16:55.380
<b>Sorry I...</b>

16:55.380 --> 16:59.500
<b>Just because I couldn't handle it...</b>

16:59.500 --> 17:03.540
<b>If you truly think that, then you should
stay off the battlefield from now on.</b>

17:12.920 --> 17:14.420
<b>Just a bit more...!</b>

17:16.540 --> 17:17.540
<b>What now?</b>

17:18.040 --> 17:19.040
<b>Misaki!</b>

17:20.630 --> 17:21.920
<b>It's no use.</b>

17:21.920 --> 17:24.290
<b>You lot aren't strong enough.</b>

17:24.290 --> 17:25.500
<b>That's not true!</b>

17:26.130 --> 17:27.750
<b>She's right.</b>

17:28.500 --> 17:32.880
<b>We can't give up no matter what odds we face.</b>

17:32.880 --> 17:33.710
<b>Right!</b>

17:40.040 --> 17:41.040
<b>Miki!</b>

17:41.040 --> 17:42.580
<b>Let's give it a try.</b>

17:42.580 --> 17:43.500
<b>What's "it"?</b>

17:43.500 --> 17:45.460
<b>That dance we've been practicing!</b>

17:46.960 --> 17:50.130
<b>We could probably use a rehearsal,
but it's worth a shot!</b>

17:50.420 --> 17:51.380
<b>Okay!</b>

18:05.040 --> 18:06.580
<b>Go get 'em, girls!</b>

18:06.580 --> 18:07.920
<b>We can do this!</b>

18:07.920 --> 18:09.290
<b>Think back on your training!</b>

18:09.500 --> 18:11.250
<b>Have faith in these celestial suits of ours!</b>

18:11.250 --> 18:12.250
<b>Got it!</b>

18:18.380 --> 18:19.580
<b>Here we go, Kokomi!</b>

18:19.580 --> 18:20.790
<b>What?</b>

18:21.880 --> 18:26.040
<b>Wait! Stop! Urara!</b>

18:37.580 --> 18:41.380
<b>Asuha and the others, they haven't given up.</b>

18:41.380 --> 18:44.630
<b>We shouldn't either, then.</b>

18:45.130 --> 18:46.420
<b>Indeed...</b>

18:48.040 --> 18:49.380
<b>That and...</b>

18:49.830 --> 18:52.000
<b>you should be a bit more confident.</b>

18:59.750 --> 19:01.130
<b>We've almost got this!</b>

19:01.460 --> 19:02.920
<b>It would appear that way.</b>

19:04.170 --> 19:05.710
<b>Don't think I've forgotten.</b>

19:06.710 --> 19:10.460
<b>You were the one who saved me back then.</b>

19:11.170 --> 19:13.790
<b>Now it's my turn to return the favor!</b>

19:21.380 --> 19:22.670
<b>I was abandoned...</b>

19:24.380 --> 19:25.750
<b>All alone...</b>

19:26.540 --> 19:30.080
<b>I thought all that was left 
for me was nothingness...</b>

19:33.130 --> 19:34.130
<b>But then...</b>

19:58.330 --> 20:01.540
<b>I want to fight for everyone here!</b>

20:02.750 --> 20:04.580
<b>Because all of them...</b>

20:04.580 --> 20:07.130
<b>all of them took me in as their friend!</b>

20:28.000 --> 20:29.830
<b>We made it.</b>

20:29.830 --> 20:32.210
<b>We're gonna be in for one 
of Asuha's talks for sure.</b>

20:38.540 --> 20:41.710
<b>S-Sadone, are you alright?</b>

20:41.710 --> 20:42.960
<b>Kaede?</b>

20:43.540 --> 20:48.040
<b>B-but just so you know, I will not put up
with something like this again!</b>

21:00.040 --> 21:01.960
<b>Now listen, you lot!</b>

21:01.960 --> 21:05.040
<b>I am sure I told you to 
refrain from going off alone!</b>

21:05.040 --> 21:07.540
<b>You pull that again and you're 
in for double training!</b>

21:07.540 --> 21:08.880
<b>Got it?</b>

21:08.880 --> 21:10.920
<b>Yes, ma'am...</b>

21:11.630 --> 21:13.380
<b>Misaki?</b>

21:16.290 --> 21:17.710
<b>Oh, uhh...</b>

21:18.790 --> 21:20.040
<b>Glad you're all right.</b>

21:20.040 --> 21:20.710
<b>Huh?</b>

21:21.750 --> 21:23.710
<b>That was a good hit.</b>

21:29.130 --> 21:35.040
<b>As soon as we heard you were in trouble,
Misaki was the first one who took off to help.</b>

21:35.460 --> 21:36.330
<b>Huh?</b>

21:37.420 --> 21:43.540
<b>You know, I think I finally understand
why she's so tough on us.</b>

21:44.420 --> 21:47.130
<b>It's just because she doesn't 
want any of us to get hurt.</b>

21:47.500 --> 21:48.670
<b>I'm sure of it.</b>

22:12.500 --> 22:18.960
<b>Things should be moving, 
but they feel stopped</b>

22:18.960 --> 22:25.290
<b>I contemplate alone, pretending to understand</b>

22:25.290 --> 22:31.710
<b>But with the end of each 
twinkle reason draws away</b>

22:31.710 --> 22:37.500
<b>Reflected in my pupils as running noise</b>

22:37.500 --> 22:44.040
<b>Consciousness trapped 
away in a lonely rondeau</b>

22:44.290 --> 22:47.710
<b>When it's held up, make your escape</b>

22:47.710 --> 22:53.080
<b>And let us perform together</b>

22:53.210 --> 23:00.040
<b>There's no one to decide but you yourself</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:06.210
<b>Whether right or wrong, it 
will all start to seem fine</b>

23:06.210 --> 23:13.000
<b>One over the other, if you believe 
it will come true someday</b>

23:13.000 --> 23:21.830
<b>The blank music score will be 
filled with a one of a kind</b>

23:22.080 --> 23:25.080
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:26.580 --> 23:29.960
<b>Our very first school festival performance
might get cancelled?</b>

23:29.960 --> 23:33.130
<b>Don't you fret. As long as we all work together
we can pull this off.</b>

23:33.130 --> 23:35.790
<b>Oh... Y-yeah, you're right! C'mon everyone!</b>

23:35.790 --> 23:37.790
<b>Next time: "Songs with Emotion".</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next Episode
Songs with Emotion
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:37.790 --> 23:40.540
<b>I'm looking forward to 
seeing you on stage, Kanon!</b>
